    {
      "id": "claim_91bbac246195452f87b19016681fcb64",
      "statement": "lib/session/get-oauth-token.ts implements the provider-aware OAuth token lookup: for provider='github' it first reads accounts (linked path) and falls back to users (primary path); for provider='vercel' it reads only the users row because no link can exist. expiresAt is populated only for accounts rows; for users rows the function explicitly sets expiresAt: null. Callers are /api/auth/info (refresh Vercel profile), /api/auth/signout (revoke upstream), and /api/vercel/teams; a parallel lib/github/user-token.ts getUserGitHubToken inlines the same accounts-first, users-fallback lookup but returns only the plaintext string for sandbox injection.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/github/user-token.ts#L21-L56",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8e38a913cb113aaba08ebf048ae2cbb62bb0101de87c436e6714a786efa9214f:"
        },
